# Normalize the whole repo to LF, in the stored blobs and on checkout. The skill runs
# on Linux/macOS/Windows and is distributed as a zip built with `git archive`; a CRLF
# file in that zip (or a CRLF checkout) is at best ugly and at worst trips a parser
# (the SKILL.md YAML frontmatter loader, notably).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep GitHub's language stats meaningful: the skill is the Python script + its docs.
docs/graph-preview.svg linguist-generated
*.md                   linguist-documentation

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.zip binary
